  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek stage aati hai logon ko samajhne ki jahan pe jo bhi tum connection ke baare mein sochte the, woh sab thoda unstable lagne lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2266
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye nahi ki duniya achanak badal jaati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2267
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na isliye ki log achanak different ho jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2268
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Balki isliye ki tumhara unhe dekhne ka tareeka dheere dheere andar se tootne lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2269
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur sabse ajeeb baat ye hai — koi obvious moment nahi hota jahan tum point karke keh sako, “yahin pe sab badal gaya.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2270
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na koi fight. Na koi ending. Na koi announcement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2271
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Bas ek gradual shift hota hai jahan andar kuch aisa hota hai jo bahar jo ho raha hota hai usse match karna band kar deta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2272
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur woh mismatch ek feeling create karta hai jise hum loss kehte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2273
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Chahe externally kuch bhi khatam na hua ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2274
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Asal mein tum life mein kabhi raw person ke saath interact nahi karte."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2275
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum hamesha unka ek constructed version hi dekhte ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2276
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek mental structure jo time ke saath build hota hai — conversations, emotional highs, chhote patterns, expectations, silence aur memories se."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2277
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab woh structure tumhare mind mein stable ho jaata hai, tum person ko directly dekhna band kar dete ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2278
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum us version ko dekhne lagte ho jo tumne khud banaya hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2279
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To jab reality thodi si bhi us internal version se shift hoti hai, mind use “situation change” ki tarah register nahi karta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2280
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Woh use “connection loss” ki tarah register karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2281
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin asal mein jo collapse ho raha hota hai woh relationship nahi hota."
