          "text": "Chahe woh sirf emotional reinforcement hi kyu na ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2380
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye log feel karte hain ki doosre log badal gaye hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2381
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum kehte hain:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2382
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Woh badal gaya.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2383,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin most cases mein person nahi badalta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2384
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hamari internal threshold for ambiguity badal jaati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2385
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jab hum emotionally stable hote hain, behavior normal lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2386
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jab hum emotionally attached hote hain, wahi behavior significant lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2387
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jab hum insecure hote hain, wahi behavior distant lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2388
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To same person different internal states mein different lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2389
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na isliye ki woh transform hua."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2390
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Balki isliye ki use different versions of us se observe kiya ja raha hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2391
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur dheere dheere ek important realization form hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2392
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum logon ko directly dekh hi nahi rahe hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2393
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum unhe apni internal condition ke reflection ki tarah dekh rahe hote ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2394
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Woh zyada tar interpretations ka cause nahi hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2395
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Woh ek surface hote hain jahan tumhara emotional state project hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2396
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab ye visible hota hai, andar kuch quietly change hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2397
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reactions kam ho jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2398
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Certainty weak ho jaati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2399
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Interpretation automatic nahi rehta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2400
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na isliye ki sab clear ho jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2401
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Balki isliye ki sab less absolute ho jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2402
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur shayad yahi real shift hai jisme ye poora understanding point karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2403
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum ek moment mein logon ko lose nahi karte."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2404
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum dheere dheere unke raw reality ke saath interact karna band kar dete ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2405
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur us version ke saath interact karne lagte ho jo tumhara mind ne banaya tha."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2406
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab woh version finally toot jaata hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2407
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "to jo bachta hai woh drama nahi hota."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2408
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na closure. Na explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2409
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Sirf reality hoti hai — bina interpretation ke upar layer kiye hue."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2410
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur woh reality unusually simple lagti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2411
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kabhi kabhi even empty."
